IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CACHEBLEND-V5.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-SHARDS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SHARD-SIZE-KB       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CACHE-CAP-MB        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CACHEBLEND-V5.
    IF NUM-SHARDS == 0 OR SHARD-SIZE-KB == 0 OR CACHE-CAP-MB == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 41400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-SHARDS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
